        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="qMZerMCtofsBWmIVCIiv-1" value="Plug the \(x\) and \(y\) coordinates of each rational point into the equation: \(axy + by - cx^2-dx-e+fxy^2+gx^2y+hy^2-ix^3\)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="WIyWlLk6GJQsqaUBKTNV-1">
          <mxGeometry x="-1460" y="475" width="330" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="qMZerMCtofsBWmIVCIiv-4" value="As \(s = 1/2 + i \gamma\) ranges over the zeros of \(L(s,E)\) , we have:&amp;nbsp;&lt;div&gt;\[\sum_{\gamma} f_{\Delta} = g_{an}(\Delta, E) + u_{an}(\Delta) + n_{an}(\Delta, E)\]&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="WIyWlLk6GJQsqaUBKTNV-1">
          <mxGeometry x="-690" y="661.5" width="320" height="98.5" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="qMZerMCtofsBWmIVCIiv-5" value="List them in an \(7\times 10\) matrix.&amp;nbsp;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="WIyWlLk6GJQsqaUBKTNV-1">
          <mxGeometry x="-1060" y="475" width="120" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="qMZerMCtofsBWmIVCIiv-8" value="Solve the matrix for the coefficients using Gaussian Elimination" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="WIyWlLk6GJQsqaUBKTNV-1">
          <mxGeometry x="-890" y="475" width="120" height="63" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="qMZerMCtofsBWmIVCIiv-9" value="Rewrite each of the solved coefficients from the RREF.&amp;nbsp;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="WIyWlLk6GJQsqaUBKTNV-1">
          <mxGeometry x="-715" y="474" width="120" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="qMZerMCtofsBWmIVCIiv-10" value="Input the cubic in the second program." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="WIyWlLk6GJQsqaUBKTNV-1">
          <mxGeometry x="-710" y="585" width="120" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="qMZerMCtofsBWmIVCIiv-11" value="Using \(\text{EllipticCurve}(F,P)\)&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;program, we find the Weierestrass form from the cubic." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="WIyWlLk6GJQsqaUBKTNV-1">
